cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use sciplot in your work, please cite it using the metadata below.
  sciplot follows Makie's design and translates much of its behaviour, so please
  also cite Makie (the reference below).
type: software
title: sciplot
abstract: >-
  Makie-style plotting for Rust: Figure/Axis layouts, GPU (wgpu) windows with
  live updates, PNG and SVG export.
